<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:ipd="urn:ipd-best-practice:trace:1.0" id="IPD_DEFINITIONS" targetNamespace="urn:ipd-best-practice:model" exporter="ipd spec2bpmn" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="L4_04_COLLAB" name="Document and classify protocol deviations">
    <bpmn:documentation>Model: L4-04
Title: Document and classify protocol deviations
Parent: L3 A4
Interface: start S1; ends E1, E2
Rule exception: ROL-03 P_INV - D1 (orchestrator default, 06 Nov 2026): Investigator/institution is an expanded pool on all levels because investigator obligations are binding steps that must appear as tasks
Rule exception: DEC-06 G1 - XOR split G1: each branch is a distinct business outcome (E1, E2) and ends in its own end event without a join
Open item: [verify interface] Neighbouring process 'Data management (correction)': a corrected data error can remove a deviation found in reconciliation (A8); no flow hand-off inside one deviation instance. Interface REQs: REQ-210.
Open item: [verify interface] Neighbouring process 'Computerised systems validation' provides the validated deviation repository used by A2 and A9 (set-up process, no flow hand-off). Interface REQs: REQ-211.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="L4_04_P_SPON" name="Sponsor" processRef="L4_04_P_SPON_PROCESS">
      <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 GL:Sponsor (p. printed 90 / PDF 98); EUCTR Art. 47 (p. OJ L 158/39); 21CFR312 21CFR312.50 (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination); E6R3 P3.1 (p. printed 4 / PDF 12); E6R3 A1-3.9.2 (p. printed 26 / PDF 34); E6R3 P10.1 (p. printed 7 / PDF 15); E6R3 P10.3 (p. printed 7 / PDF 15); E6R3 A1-3.9.5 (p. printed 27 / PDF 35); E6R3 A2-3.8 (p. printed 62 / PDF 70); EMA-SB SGlossary (p. printed 3/21); TCB-RBQM SQTL-Process (p. journal pp. 251-261 (section page not confirmed))</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <ipd:trace>
          <ipd:source key="E6R3" loc="GL:Sponsor" page="printed 90 / PDF 98" />
