          <ipd:verify>[verify binding] EU/US adoption of E3QA not checked by the research stems (C-06)</ipd:verify>
          <ipd:verify>[verify] single detailed fetch; wording 'reasonable to consider' not confirmed verbatim (R5-003)</ipd:verify>
