    <bpmn:task id="L4_04_A4" name="Request explanation of important protocol deviation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Sources: E6R3 A1-2.5.3 (p. printed 13 / PDF 21)
Requirements: REQ-093
Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH
Record: explanation of important deviation
